    <string name="document_keyboard_shortcuts_body">Ctrl+F: Find\nCtrl+H: Replace in source\nF3 / Shift+F3: Next / Previous match\nCtrl+G: Go to line in source\nCtrl+Alt+Left / Right: Previous / Next location\n\nIn the Find query:\nEnter / Shift+Enter: Next / Previous match\nCtrl+Enter: Insert line break\n\nCtrl+A / C / X / V: Select all / Copy / Cut / Paste in the focused text or document\nShift+Left / Right: Extend selection\nCtrl+Z: Undo\nCtrl+Shift+Z or Ctrl+Y: Redo\n\nArrow keys adjust a focused selection handle. Escape dismisses Find or the current selection. Apply replacements explicitly with its button.</string>
